# Environment variables
#
# This project intentionally requires NO environment variables.
#
# The invoice rules are pure functions in the two API routes, the sample data is
# a local JSON file, and there is no database, auth provider, or third-party API.
# Copy this file to .env.local if you later add any — .env.local is gitignored.
#
# Provided automatically by Vercel at build time (do not set these yourself):
#   VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL   used to build absolute Open Graph URLs
#   VERCEL_URL                      per-deployment URL, fallback for the above
